theme = ExtResource("3_5nlpe")
text = "Welcome to \"MY ROLE IN THE GRAND SCHEME\"

In the grimy alleys of NEW-CAELUM, you're a former professional turned PRIVATE EYE. The city is a cesspool of corruption and crime, where every shadow hides a secret. Your mission? Solve cases ranging from petty crimes to scandals involving the city's elite.

To navigate this brutal world, you'll use CARDS representing various concepts to INTERROGATE CHARACTERS, search LOCATIONS, and gather CLUES and INFORMATION (you may even have to FIGHT but we wish that you won't have to). These cards are your tools to \"talk\" with the \"GREAT ONE\", shaping events and determining your actions. Each card can represent an ACTION, a SKILL, an OBJECT, a LOCATION, or even a CHARACTER... Choose wisely; every decision could mean the difference between LIFE and DEATH.

THE GAME IS DELIBERATELY TOUGH, mirroring the challenges of a radical life change. Prepare to face criminals and unpredictable situations. Your old job didn't pay much, and neither does this new one. Too late to back out now. You'll need to MANAGE your DAILY DRUG HABIT, pay WEEKLY BILLS, control your EMOTIONS, and avoid PISSING OFF THE AUTHORITIES. Staying alert is crucial for survival. But don't let it drive you to PARANOIA!

To ORGANIZE your FINDINGS, you'll have an INVESTIGATION BOARD on the wall. PIN CARDS representing collected INFORMATION and CONNECT THEM with COLORED STRINGS based on the RELATIONSHIPS you UNCOVER. Each string symbolizes a link between CLUES, CHARACTERS, and LOCATIONS, helping you DEFINE a MOTIVE, IDENTIFY a CULPRIT, and PIECE TOGETHER EVENTS.

As you INTERACT, you'll KEEP or DISCARD certain CARDS, building your PERSONALIZED DECK just as you would TRAIN to IMPROVE YOUR SKILLS. Each MASTERED CARD becomes a VALUABLE ASSET, helping you navigate the game's challenges. YOUR CHARACTER WILL EVOLVE based on your MAJOR SUCCESSES or MONUMENTAL FAILURES, shaping your journey uniquely.

Each case is a new adventure, bringing you closer to the ULTIMATE TRUTH. But be warned, in this dark world, the truth can be more dangerous than you imagine. Nevertheless, SOLVING A CASE will give you some FINANCIAL BREATHING ROOM, maybe even a bit more.

New-Caelum isn't a city for the faint-hearted. Criminals lurk, waiting for the perfect moment to strike. Be ready for anything and use your skills to navigate this world of shadows.

DB"
